  data: {
    LLM: "1. Play a card from your hand.\n2. Draw a card from the deck and play it to the table.\n3. **Capturing**: You capture a card if your card and the table card SUM TO 10 (e.g., 4 captures 6).\n4. **Face Cards**: 10, J, Q, K are captured by an IDENTICAL rank (e.g., King captures King).\n5. If your card doesn't capture anything, it stays on the table.",
    Player: "1. Play a card from your hand.\n2. Draw a card from the deck and play it to the table.\n3. **Capturing**: You capture a card if your card and the table card SUM TO 10 (e.g., 4 captures 6).\n4. **Face Cards**: 10, J, Q, K are captured by an IDENTICAL rank (e.g., King captures King).\n5. If your card doesn't capture anything, it stays on the table.",
    objective: 'Capture as many red cards as possible, specifically those with high point values.',
    gameplay: "1. Play a card from your hand.\n2. Draw a card from the deck and play it to the table.\n3. **Capturing**: You capture a card if your card and the table card SUM TO 10 (e.g., 4 captures 6).\n4. **Face Cards**: 10, J, Q, K are captured by an IDENTICAL rank (e.g., King captures King).\n5. If your card doesn't capture anything, it stays on the table.",
    keyRules: [
      'Capture by sum to 10 (e.g. 4 captures 6) or by matching rank for 10/J/Q/K.',
      'Only red cards (Hearts, Diamonds) score points; black cards are for capturing.',
      'Each turn: play one card from hand, then draw one from stock and play it to the table.',
